    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. what specifically should i be doing to protect that data from being accessed by people who aren't supposed to see it? like, are there certain ways i should be storing everything to make sure nothing gets lost or stolen?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
