      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To protect your customer data, you need to implement strong technical and organizational measures. For digital storage, use encryption—think of it like locking your data in a secure, heavily guarded digital vault, so only authorized personnel with the right key can see it. If you use third-party services (like your e-commerce platform), make sure they are GDPR compliant and have strong security protocols in place. Regular backups are also essential so that if something goes wrong, you don't lose any customer records.",
